      "title": "Pathfinder references and run settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Wan2.1 VACE: Pathfinder reference-to-video\n\n- Five Pathfinder views are stitched into a single reference board because the native `WanVaceToVideo` node uses one reference-image input.\n- 640 × 480, 61 frames, 12 fps = 5.08 seconds.\n- Uses Wan2.1 VACE 1.3B + FP8 text encoder on an 8 GB GPU. The CausVid LoRA is bypassed for the higher-quality 20-step path.\n- Output is written below `ComfyUI/output/video/ComfyUI`.\n\nThe prompt requires a retracted contact arm, continuously rotating wheels and fresh tracks in entirely natural, unprepared Mars terrain."
      ]
    }
